# Orders and payments

- Keep server-side price calculation as the source of truth. Never trust client-submitted totals, delivery fees, or discount amounts.
- Reuse existing helpers: `getCalendarPrice`, `getDeliveryPrice`, `getDiscountAmount`, `lib/order-payments`, `lib/order-payment-token`.
- Preserve Zod validation, rate limiting, finalize-token checks, and Turnstile where the flow already uses them.
- Stripe webhooks must verify `stripe-signature` via `constructEvent` before any order mutation.
- Do not weaken payment status transitions or mark orders paid outside the existing Stripe/payment helpers.
- Return minimal client errors; keep payment secrets and full payloads server-side only.
